'''Çıraqqala Siyəzən FK''' ({{langx|az|Çıraqqala Siyəzən Futbol Klubu}}) was an [[Azerbaijan]]i [[football (soccer)|football]] club from [[Siyəzən]] founded in 1991.<ref>{{cite web|title=Azerbaijan&nbsp;– List of Foundation Dates|url=https://www.rsssf.org/tablesa/azerfound.html|publisher= The Rec.Sport.Soccer Statistics Foundation|accessdate=3 January 2014}}</ref> They played in the [[Azerbaijan Premier League|Azerbaijan Top Division]] for only one season, 1992, before relegation to the [[Azerbaijan First Division]]. They dissolved two years later at the end of the 1993–94 season."}}
